      <h2 id="hw-h">
        When your tier changes
      </h2>
      <p id="hw-p">
        Your tier is whatever your $RECEIPT is worth right now, at the market price. Buy more and you move up immediately; if the price falls or you sell, you move down the same way. Nothing is held back or averaged.
