      <p class="fine">
        Tiers are set by the ladder the server publishes, and this page reads it live — what is shown here is what the rule applies. Amounts are in US dollars. Rewards are tokenized stock: debt securities giving economic exposure to the share price, not ownership, not voting rights, and not an interest in the merchant. Nothing here is investment advice.
